2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO] V2.5.18 [SMA8 ENTRY-AWARE FIX + CHOP-GATE RE-ARM — 2026-06-19]
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + CONTEXT: 2026-06-19 (paper) — gap-down day. One V3 PE (24000PE @114) entered
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     correctly at 10:15 on a Grade-A R-cluster break, but SMA8_LOW_TRAIL exited it
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     31s later at +1.6 (the trail evaluated the 10:00 bar — which CLOSED BEFORE
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     entry — against today's lows-avg). Spot then fell 24040->23926 without us;
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     morning chop-gate (ER=0.01, range=70pt) then stood aside the rest of the day.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + FIX A (SMA8 pre-entry bar): the SMA8(low) trail now NEVER acts on a 15m bar
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     whose CLOSE time (bar-start + 15m) is <= POS.entry_time. A fresh entry can no
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     longer be ejected on price action that happened before it was opened.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + FIX C (SMA8 arm window): trail arms on bars-SINCE-ENTRY, not bars-of-day.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     sma8_low_of_option() now averages only TODAY's closed bars that closed AFTER
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     entry and needs >= SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS_SINCE_ENTRY (1) of them. With 1 own bar
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     SMA8L == that bar's own low, so close(>=low) can't trigger -> first real
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     trigger needs >=2 own bars. SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS (4, bars-of-day) is now only
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     the fallback when entry_time is unknown (state-load edge). NOT a BE-gate.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + CHOP-GATE RE-ARM (CHOP_REARM_ENABLED): after a morning stand-aside, release
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     the block when a CLOSED FUT 15m bar breaks the recorded first-hour range by
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     >= CHOP_REARM_BUFFER_PT (15pt) with body >= CHOP_REARM_BODY_MIN (65%), in the
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     regime direction (BULL=>up-break only, BEAR=>down-break only, else either).
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     FUT leads spot, so this triggers earlier than a spot-range break. Re-arm is
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     one-way for the day (stays live once released); per-trade momentum/fade/CB
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     guards still apply. _morning_chop_verdict_impl() stashes FH hi/lo;
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     chop_rearm_check() evaluated each cycle while blocked. Logs [CHOPGATE] RE-ARMED.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + Ladder/HARDSL/flip/VWAP-trail/stale-guard UNCHANGED. SMA8 KEPT (deleting it
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     cost -66pt, V2.5.16) — this only changes WHEN it may fire, not whether.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + NOT yet sim-A/B'd — shipped on user direction 2026-06-19; backtest the
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     re-arm thresholds on post-chop trend days before relying on it live.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO] 
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO] V2.5.19 [THREE FUT-VWAP ENTRY PATHWAYS — 2026-06-21]
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]   + Built on user direction 2026-06-21. THREE new VWAP-cross entry pathways.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     NOT yet sim-A/B'd — BACKTEST before flipping start_orion.sh to V2.5.19.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO]     All three are flag-gated (default ON). Existing V2/V3/FLIP UNCHANGED.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,307 [INFO] 
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]   + FEATURE 1 — FUT 15m VWAP cross + CONFIRMATION CANDLE (all-day).
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     VWAP15_CONFIRM_ENABLED. The existing VWAP engine no longer fires on the
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     cross bar alone: it now requires the cross bar (iloc[-3], body 65-86% band)
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     PLUS the next closed bar (iloc[-2]) to CONFIRM in the same direction —
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     same-colour candle that still closes on the same side of FUT-VWAP. Fires in
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     either direction, any time in the entry window. Re-entries are governed by
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     the existing momentum gate (no extra cap). check_vwap_signal().
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: "confirmation candle in same direction" = next 15m candle
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     closes same side of its open (same colour) AND same side of VWAP as the
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     cross. Confirmation candle has NO body-size requirement (only the cross bar
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     does). If wrong, adjust _vwap15_confirm_ok().
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO] 
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]   + FEATURE 2 — FUT 5m VWAP cross + S/R distance, FIXED +12 TARGET scalp.
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     FUT5_SCALP_ENABLED. New engine 'FUT5VWAP'. On each closed FUT 5m bar that
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     CROSSES its session VWAP (bar opens one side, closes the other) with body
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     65-86% AND whose close is > FUT5_SCALP_SR_MIN_DIST (20pt) from EVERY one of
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     yesterday's classic pivots S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Exit is
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     a FIXED +FUT5_SCALP_TARGET_PTS (12) option points (HARDSL + 15:25 force-close
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     still apply; NO trail/SMA8). One trade per event: deduped on the 5m bar ts,
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     so the next entry needs a fresh qualifying cross. check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: ">20 points away from s1/r1/s2/r2" = min distance to ALL four
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     pivots > 20pt (price in clear space, not hugging a pivot). "cross" = bar
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     open & close on opposite sides of VWAP. Pivots = classic floor-trader pivots
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     from the prior trading day's H/L/C. If wrong, adjust compute_classic_pivots()
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     / check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO] 
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]   + FEATURE 3 — MORNING 09:15-10:15 exception (bypasses the 09:45 start gate).
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     MORNING_VWAP_ENABLED. Before the normal 09:45 entry start, between
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     MORNING_WIN_START (09:15) and MORNING_WIN_END (10:15): if a closed FUT 15m
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     bar crosses its VWAP (body 65-86%) AND its close is > MORNING_VWAP_SR_MIN_DIST
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     (20pt) from every pivot S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Re-entries
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     per momentum gate. Uses engine 'VWAP' (so it inherits the VWAP option-VWAP
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     trail exit). Runs even when in_entry_window() is False; still respects
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     stale-guard, gap-suppress, CB/halt, manual cooldown. check_morning_vwap15_signal().
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: this only ADDS the pre-09:45 window; from 09:45 on, the
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     normal engines (incl. Feature 1) already run. No confirmation candle is
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     required here (spec did not ask for one).
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO] 
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]   + Classic pivots computed at boot from prior-day H/L/C → DAY.pivots
2026-07-22 03:32:05,308 [INFO]     {P,S1,R1,S2,R2}; min_dist_to_pivots() helper. New fetch_nifty_fut_5m().
